    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "**1. Financial Question and Context**\n",
        "\n",
        "How does the daily lowest price (Daily Low) of Apple stock behave relative to its technical lower bound (Lower Band - 'dn'), and how does this relationship vary on an annual basis? This analysis investigates how frequently and how deeply the stock price approaches or breaks below this threshold. The goal is to identify periods of extreme downward pressure within the historical sample and to capture their average annual trend."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "RbDOzuCb4Blc"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "# 2. Imports and data source"
